  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Kotak Infinite is an invite-only credit card that is exclusively offered to Kotak Private Banking customers. This card offers a personalized card design along with basic rewards, travel & golf benefits. For frequent travellers, it charges a low forex markup fee of 2% along with complimentary domestic lounge visits. Besides travel, the card offers moderate golf benefits, including up to 24 free golf rounds every year, along with 2 guest visits per year. Cardholders can earn 1 point per Rs. 125 spent across all categories, which can later be redeemed against recharges, products & vouchers, and more through the rewards catalogue. Note: Kotak Mahindra Bank has discontinued _the issuance of this card for new customer_ s. The features and benefits available on this page apply only to existing credit cardholders.__",
