    "faqs": [
      {
        "q": "Who is eligible for the Kotak Infinite Credit Card?",
        "a": "Kotak Infinite Credit Card is an invite-only card, primarily for Kotak Private Banking customers. Invitations are extended to select customers based on their profile and banking relationship with Kotak."
      },
      {
        "q": "What are the key travel benefits of this card?",
        "a": "Kotak Infinite Credit Card offers a low forex markup fee of 2%, making international transactions cost-effective. Additionally, the card provides 4 complimentary domestic airport lounge visits every quarter."
      },
      {
        "q": "What golf-related perks does the Kotak Infinite Credit Card offer?",
        "a": "Cardholders can avail 2 complimentary rounds of golf per month and free tee-offs at select premium golf courses. Cardholders can also invite up to 2 guests for a complimentary round once every quarter."
      },
      {
        "q": "How are rewards earned and redeemed?",
        "a": "Cardholders can earn 1 reward point for every Rs. 125 spent on all purchases. Reward points can be redeemed through the Kotak rewards catalogue for products, gift vouchers, mobile/DTH recharges, and other available redemption options."
      },
      {
        "q": "Are there any fees associated with the card?",
        "a": "Kotak Infinite Credit Card comes with no joining or annual fee. Finance charges are 3.50% per month (42% p.a.), and late payment fees vary based on the outstanding amount, ranging from Rs. 100 to Rs. 1,200."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does the card provide benefits outside of travel and golf?",
        "a": "Yes, but they are limited. Benefits include a 1% fuel surcharge waiver on transactions between Rs. 400 and Rs. 7,500 (capped at Rs. 4,500/year) and a railway surcharge waiver for bookings via IRCTC or Indian Railways (capped at Rs. 500/year)."
      }
    ]
